# ParkOpt master prompt

Work only on the existing ParkOpt project (`goraka1807/ParkOpt_2`). Do not create a new project. Frontend: `frontend/parkopt/`. Stack: React, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, Supabase, PostgreSQL, Edge Functions.

Fix the existing app, make it functional, polish last. Keep changes small. Inspect before editing. Preserve uncommitted work. No destructive Git operations.

## Design

The current homepage is the starting point. Do not redesign from scratch. Preserve midnight navy, electric lime, large headline, tilted phone mockup, glowing status pills, and headline blast / phone tilt effects. Keep the desktop composition recognizable. Do not replace it with a generic dashboard. Do not drop working animations to make layout easier.

## Mobile

Headline readable. Phone mockup must not cover copy. Description visible. Primary button usable (visible, tappable, not overlapping). Reflow on small screens; keep the identity.

## Polish

Polish only after core flows work (home → discover → facility → booking → guidance).
